OL,3,APolice crack down on 'cockroach'
OL,4,Aprotest in Delhi as group says leaders
OL,5,Adetained
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of security personnel
OL,8,Fhave been deployed and roads barricaded
OL,9,Fin Delhi to stop the latest Cockroach
OL,10,FJanta Party demonstration
OL,12,FThe group says its leader, Abhijeet
OL,13,FDipke, is among hundreds reportedly
OL,14,Fdetained since Friday evening - our
OL,15,Fcorrespondent says it's clear these
OL,16,Fprotesters have struck a nerve
OL,18,FWatch the moment Dipke and others chant
OL,19,F"long live the revolution" as police
OL,20,Fapproach him on a plane in Delhi
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
